{
  "about": "F2-4 shared fixture: the needed-by the phone sheet (day chip plus slot, or Other time) and the web dialog (datetime-local) send for the same wall clock in the organization's zone, and the instant the server stores for it (core wallClockToInstant, strict). instant null: that wall clock does not exist in the zone, and the server refuses it (invalid_time). Read by needed-by-wall-clock-parity.test.ts; the web dialog's test can read the same file.",
